before:
Complete local Rust example; the app itself does not execute it:
```rust
fn label(value: Option<i32>) -> &'static str {
    match value {
        Some(n) if n > 0 => "positive",
        Some(_) => "nonpositive",
        None => "missing",
    }
}
fn main() { println!("{}", label(Some(3))); }
```

